Native API retained source iteration on Sakana AI Agentic Scientist.
Base: 2b8aa39285c35aaca3b0e06dd121061ef8a2d854, then local_api_backend.patch,
native_campaign_semantics.patch and native_posthoc.patch, in that order.
Sakana AI's upstream Apache-2.0 attribution and LICENSE are retained.
This extension reuses the upstream controller, evaluation and program_clone;
it does not modify the canonical stock submodule or add a second scheduler.

